.", "by": "M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"}, "tr": {"text": "Sizin ilâhınız, ancak kendisinden başka hiçbir ilâh bulunmayan Allah'dır. Onun ilmi her şeyi kuşatmıştır.", "by": "Elmalılı Hamdi Yazır, via tanzil.net"}, "ur": {"text": "تمہارا معبود تو وہی اللہ ہے جس کے سوا کسی کی بندگی نہیں ہر چیز کو اس کا علم محیط ہے،", "by": "احمد رضا خان، کنز الایمان · tanzil.net"}, "id": {"text": "Sesungguhnya Tuhanmu hanyalah Allah, yang tidak ada Tuhan selain Dia. Pengetahuan-Nya meliputi segala sesuatu\".", "by": "Kementerian Agama RI, via tanzil.net"}}, "words": [{"text": "إِنَّمَآ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "إِلَٰهُكُمُ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "ٱللَّهُ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "ٱلَّذِى", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "لَآ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "إِلَٰهَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "إِلَّا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "هُوَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "وَسِعَ", "hit": true, "audio": "audio/838fe1841e2d00816d10.m4a", "gloss": {"bs": "obuhvata", "en": "(He) encompasses", "tr": "(O) kuşatır", "fr": "(Il) embrasse", "id": "(Dia) meliputi", "ur": "(وہ) سمایا ہوا ہے", "bn": "(তিনি) পরিব্যাপ্ত করেন", "fa": "(او) فراگرفته است"}}, {"text": "كُلَّ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "شَىْءٍ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "عِلْمًا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}]}], "forms": [{"arabic": "وَسِعَ", "count": 4, "first": "2:255", "audio": "audio/838fe1841e2d00816d10.m4a", "grammar": [{"tense": "past", "pronoun": "huwa", "passive": false, "objects": []}], "gloss": {"bs": "obuhvata", "en": "(He) encompasses", "tr": "(O) kuşatır", "fr": "(Il) embrasse", "id": "(Dia) meliputi", "ur": "(وہ) سمایا ہوا ہے", "bn": "(তিনি) পরিব্যাপ্ত করেন", "fa": "(او) فراگرفته است"}}, {"arabic": "وَسِعَتْ", "count": 1, "first": "7:156", "audio": "audio/c6f86b9ad5519c64bea2.m4a", "grammar": [{"tense": "past", "pronoun": "hiya", "passive": false, "objects": []}], "gloss": {"en": "she/it encompassed", "bs": "obuhvatila je", "tr": "kuşattı", "fr": "elle a englobé", "id": "dia telah meliputi", "ur": "وہ گھیر لیتی ہے", "bn": "সে পরিবেষ্টন করল", "fa": "احاطه کرد"}}, {"arabic": "وَسِعْتَ", "count": 1, "first": "40:7", "audio": "audio/c91aa4dd4ce1768014bc.m4a", "grammar": [{"tense": "past", "pronoun": "anta", "passive": false, "objects": []}], "gloss": {"en": "you encompassed", "bs": "obuhvatio si", "tr": "kuşattın", "fr": "tu as englobé", "id": "kamu telah meliputi", "ur": "تم نے گھیر لیا", "bn": "তুমি পরিবেষ্টন করেছ", "fa": "احاطه کردی"}}], "ayatFile": "ayat/0439.json", "ayatTranslations": {"en": "ayat/0439.en.json", "tr": "ayat/0439.tr.json", "ur": "ayat/0439.ur.json", "id": "ayat/0439.id.json"}, "sentences": [{"arabic": "وَسِعَ الْبَيْتُ الضُّيُوفَ", "spoken": "audio/bf31fa4dbde72a81db4c.m4a", "tense": "past", "pronoun": "huwa", "translation": {"bs": "Kuća je primila goste.", "en": "The house had room for the guests.", "bn": "ঘরে অতিথিদের জায়গা হলো।", "fa": "خانه جای مهمانان را داشت.", "fr": "La maison a pu contenir les invités.", "id": "Rumah itu memuat para tamu.", "tr": "Ev misafirlere yer oldu.", "ur": "گھر میں مہمانوں کی گنجائش تھی۔"}, "independentlyReviewed": true, "words": [{"arabic": "وَسِعَ", "target": true, "translation": {"bs": "primila je", "en": "had room for", "bn": "স্থান হলো", "fa": "جا داشت", "fr": "a pu contenir", "id": "memuat", "tr": "yer oldu", "ur": "سما لیا"}}, {"arabic": "الْبَيْتُ", "target": false, "translation": {"bs": "kuća", "en": "the house", "bn": "ঘরটি", "fa": "خانه", "fr": "la maison", "id": "rumah itu", "tr": "ev", "ur": "گھر"}}, {"arabic": "الضُّيُوفَ", "target": false, "translation": {"bs": "goste", "en": "the guests", "bn": "অতিথিদের", "fa": "مهمانان", "fr": "les invités", "id": "para tamu", "tr": "misafirler", "ur": "مہمان (جمع)"}}]}, {"arabic": "وَسِعَتِ الْقَاعَةُ الْجَمِيعَ", "spoken": "audio/f7ae12fb5b21b1afe546.m4a", "tense": "past", "pronoun": "hiya", "translation": {"bs": "Sala je primila sve.", "en": "The hall had room for everyone.", "bn": "হলঘরে সবার জায়গা হলো।", "fa": "سالن جای همه را داشت.", "fr": "La salle a pu contenir tout le monde.", "id": "Aula itu memuat semua orang.", "tr": "Salon herkese yer oldu.", "ur": "ہال میں سب سما گئے۔"}, "independentlyReviewed": true, "words": [{"arabic": "وَسِعَتِ", "target": true, "translation": {"bs": "primila je", "en": "had room for", "bn": "স্থান হলো", "fa": "جا داشت", "fr": "a pu contenir", "id": "memuat", "tr": "yer oldu", "ur": "سما لیا"}}, {"arabic": "الْقَاعَةُ", "target": false, "translation": {"bs": "sala", "en": "the hall", "bn": "হলঘর", "fa": "سالن", "fr": "la salle", "id": "aula", "tr": "salon", "ur": "ہال"}}, {"arabic": "الْجَمِيعَ", "target": false, "translation": {"bs": "sve", "en": "everyone", "bn": "সবাই", "fa": "همه", "fr": "tout le monde", "id": "semua orang", "tr": "herkes", "ur": "سب"}}]}, {"arabic": "وَسِعْتَ النَّاسَ بِأَخْلَاقِكَ", "spoken": "audio/e01a806f3ab9ea9a6713.m4a", "tense": "past", "pronoun": "anta", "translation": {"bs": "Svojim lijepim ponašanjem si prigrlio ljude.", "en": "You embraced people with your good character.", "bn": "তুমি তোমার সুন্দর চরিত্র দিয়ে মানুষকে আপন করে নিলে।", "fa": "تو با اخلاق نیکویت مردم را در برگرفتی.", "fr": "Tu as embrassé les gens par ton bon caractère.", "id": "Engkau merangkul orang-orang dengan akhlakmu yang baik.", "tr": "Güzel ahlâkınla insanları kucakladın.", "ur": "تم نے اپنے اچھے اخلاق سے لوگوں کو سمو لیا۔"}, "independentlyReviewed": true, "words": [{"arabic": "وَسِعْتَ", "target": true, "translation": {"bs": "prigrlio si", "en": "you encompassed", "bn": "তুমি ধারণ করলে", "fa": "تو فراگرفتی", "fr": "tu as embrassé", "id": "engkau merangkul", "tr": "kucakladın", "ur": "تم نے سمو لیا"}}, {"arabic": "النَّاسَ", "target": false, "translation": {"bs": "ljude", "en": "people", "bn": "মানুষ", "fa": "مردم", "fr": "les gens", "id": "orang-orang", "tr": "insanlar", "ur": "لوگ"}}, {"arabic": "بِأَخْلَاقِكَ", "target": false, "translation": {"bs": "svojim lijepim ponašanjem", "en": "with your good character", "bn": "তোমার সুন্দর চরিত্র দিয়ে", "fa": "با اخلاق نیکوی تو", "fr": "par ton bon caractère", "id": "dengan akhlakmu yang baik", "tr": "güzel ahlâkınla", "ur": "تمہارے اچھے اخلاق سے"}}]}]}